Evidence":"午前の部","notes":["verified_pdf_text","official_diagrams_only"]},"verification":{"questionText":"runtime_pdf_checked","choices":"runtime_pdf_checked","answer":"same_year_official_answer_checked","visual":"official_pdf_crop_rendered","field":"verified"},"learningStrategy":{"method":"unclassified","confidence":"unknown","contrastTopicIds":[]}},{"sourceMode":"runtime_official_pdf","qualificationId":"land_surveyor","year":2021,"section":"午前の部","questionId":"land_surveyor:2021:午前の部:5","questionNumber":5,"fieldId":"l1","unitId":null,"stem":"トータルステーションを用いた縮尺1/1000 の地形図作成において,標高2127 m の\n位置から,ある道路上のA 点の観測を行ったところ,高低角が29°,斜距離が20 m と\nの観測結果が得られた。その後,A 点にトータルステーションを設置し,A 点と同じ\n道路上にあるB 点を観測したところ,B 点の標高が2233 m,A 点からB 点までの水平\n距離が92 m との観測結果が得られた。この場合において,A 点とB 点との間を結ぶ直\n線と,これを横断する標高2200 m 地点の等高線との交点をC 点としたとき,B 点から\nC 点までの地形図上の長さとして最も近いものは,後記1 から5 までのうち,どれか。","stemMode":"text","choices":["2.5 cm","2.8 cm","3.1 cm","3.4 cm","3.7 cm"],"choiceMode":"text","correctAnswer":3,"diagramRequired":false,"figures":[],"questionPdfUrl":"https://izuki.net/wp-content/uploads/c_r3am_q.pdf","answerPdfUrl":"https://izuki.net/wp-content/uploads/c_r3_a.pdf","questionPdfSha256":"0a254b7da1dfc210da8ccdd008630184206dd0bf94ec3d41f667873a230b8f91","answerPdfSha256":"a9b2040148309b64690cf5e74b942da286a887f8106fecdeed99a37879f67de7","evidence":{"questionPdfPages":[6],"questionRect":[30,800],"field":"official_exam_section","fieldEvidence":"午前の部","notes":["verified_pdf_text","official_diagrams_only"]},"verification":{"questionText":"runtime_pdf_checked","choices":"runtime_pdf_checked","answer":"same_year_official_answer_checked","visual":"question_level_pdf_graphics_checked","field":"verified"},"learningStrategy":{"method":"unclassified","confidence":"unknown","contrastTopicIds":[]}},{"sourceMode":"runtime_official_pdf","qualificationId":"land_surveyor","year":2021,"section":"午前の部","questionId":"land_surveyor:2021:午前の部:6","questionNumber":6,"fieldId":"l1","unitId":null,"stem":"無人航空機(以下「UAV」という。)を使用する測量